  "title": "The Scribe's Cellars",
  "language": "",
  "intro": "A scribe lost her book of words in the cellars under the old library. Find the way down, break the sealed doors with your words, and bring the book back!",
  "ending": "At the bottom of the pit lies the scribe's book. Every word in it is one you now know. Well done, hero!",
